                            <comment id="16752967" author="ignitetcbot" created="Sat, 26 Jan 2019 09:04:03 +0000"  >&lt;div class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: #ccc;border-style: dashed;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;panelHeader&quot; style=&quot;border-bottom-width: 1px;border-bottom-style: dashed;border-bottom-color: #ccc;background-color: #D6F7C1;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All: No blockers found!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=2897565&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_RunAll&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;b&gt;--&amp;gt; Run :: All&lt;/b&gt; Results&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16753915" author="ilyak" created="Mon, 28 Jan 2019 11:31:53 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;LGTM if it is OK that initializeLocalAddresses no longer checks discoveryClientMode() that it used to.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16754716" author="xtern" created="Tue, 29 Jan 2019 08:12:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ilyak&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ilyak&quot;&gt;ilyak&lt;/a&gt;, thank you.&lt;br/&gt;
The main problem described and fixed in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9858&quot; title=&quot;[Test Failed] SystemCacheNotConfiguredTest#test flaky fails on TC (timeout).&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-9858&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-9858&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; relies on this change in &lt;tt&gt;initializeLocalAddresses&lt;/tt&gt;. I don&apos;t think we should revert it, and I don&apos;t think that this change affects users who use public API.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;After running tests I updated PR with minor javadoc correction (&quot;May &lt;del&gt;return&lt;/del&gt; &lt;b&gt;contain&lt;/b&gt; an invalid Ignite instance&quot;).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16755033" author="ilyak" created="Tue, 29 Jan 2019 14:07:11 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=xtern&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;xtern&quot;&gt;xtern&lt;/a&gt; thank you for the fix! I have merged it to master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
